      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} I couldn't FIND the event occurance, so by the time I found them out, i was rate limited. \n\nEither way, the rate limit is way way way too low. We have several events per day, and stuff needs updated and consolidated with templates and new info, new events, one off events, and etc.\n\nI shouldn't have to spend 20 minutes once per hour for like 8 hours to get all this work done, esp when I have to use 1 occurance of my rate limit to fix a typo or see what characters are allowed in titled, etc. :(",
