  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Can you:\n\n1.) Fix the error message to reflect the true error (rate limit)\n\n2.) Remove/Fix the damned ass rate limit for bigger groups. It takes me 3 months just to fix and upload and update all our events because I made a typo and it counts towards my 10 an hour or whatever. \n\nThe rate limit should affect bots not me trying to get my calendar together.",
